  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "The Consignment Module integration in Dash SaaS streamlines the creation and management of consignment agreements for businesses. Within the platform, users can easily generate customized consignment agreements tailored to their specific needs. These agreements can include detailed terms and conditions, pricing structures, commission rates, Tax calculation and inventory specifications. By providing a centralized platform for agreement creation, businesses can ensure consistency and accuracy across all their consignment partnerships, fostering stronger relationships with consignment partners and minimizing the risk of disputes.": "Интеграция модуля консигнации в Dash SaaS упрощает создание и управление договорами консигнации для бизнеса. ",
  "/Month": "/Месяц",
  "/Year": "/Год",
  "Buy Now": "Купить сейчас",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "Efficient ": "Эффективный ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " Отслеживание запасов ",
  " and Management": " и менеджмент",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "С помощью модуля консигнации компании могут эффективно отслеживать и управлять консигнационными товарами в Dash SaaS. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "Просмотр и цены на консигнационные продукты",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "Модуль комиссионных позволяет пользователям просматривать полный список продуктов в партии, обеспечивая полную видимость запасов. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "Создание и преобразование заказов на поставку",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "В модуле комиссий пользователи могут создавать подробные заказы на покупку и легко конвертировать эти заказы в фактические покупки. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "Создание и преобразование заказов на продажу",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "Модуль комиссионных также поддерживает создание заказов на продажу, которые можно легко преобразовать в завершенные продажи. ",
